AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::setLiquidationEngine()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketUnsupportedOperation for zero or nonzero input
    ├── it should not call the proposed liquidation engine
    ├── it should leave liquidationEngine at zero
    ├── it should not emit SetLiquidationEngine
    └── it should remain unsupported while paused or frozen
